# General instructions

- Be concise
- When there is multiple options, choose the simplest one
  Do not try to implement multiple options
- Do not write markdown to describe things you implemented
- Follow RFC2119 <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2119>
- Do not write comments that repeat what's shown in the code
- Do not use magic numbers, always define variable, constants, etc.
